_Mar_2011.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/12/Barn_Barber%C3%AAche_Mar_2011.jpg/500px-Barn_Barber%C3%AAche_Mar_2011.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A bridge barn in Switzerland. The bridge (rather than a ramp) in this case also shelters animals.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABarn_Barber%C3%AAche_Mar_2011.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5b/Starke_Round_Barn_in_Red_Cloud%2C_Nebraska.jpg/500px-Starke_Round_Barn_in_Red_Cloud%2C_Nebraska.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5b/Starke_Round_Barn_in_Red_Cloud%2C_Nebraska.jpg/1280px-Starke_Round_Barn_in_Red_Cloud%2C_Nebraska.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5b/Starke_Round_Barn_in_Red_Cloud%2C_Nebraska.jpg/500px-Starke_Round_Barn_in_Red_Cloud%2C_Nebraska.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Starke Round Barn in Red Cloud, Nebraska, the largest freestanding barn in the United States.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AStarke_Round_Barn_in_Red_Cloud%2C_Nebraska.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1a/Beautiful_Post_and_Beam_Horse_Barn.JPG/500px-Beautiful_Post_and_Beam_Horse_Barn.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1a/Beautiful_Post_and_Beam_Horse_Barn.JPG/1280px-Beautiful_Post_and_Beam_Horse_Barn.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1a/Beautiful_Post_and_Beam_Horse_Barn.JPG/500px-Beautiful_Post_and_Beam_Horse_Barn.JPG?utm_source=en.wikiped